	// DIALOGUE

	// -apprentice
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.answer.leave": "Wir sehen uns.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.answer.spar": "Wanna spar?",

	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.1": "Vorsichtig damit, du hast beinahe meinen Arm erwischt.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.2": "Es heißt, die Propheten wachen über jeden einzelnen von uns. Glaubst du das?",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.3": "Ich bin hier schon seit heute Morgen und habe kaum Lux gesammelt.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.4": "Mein Bündnis erzählt mir andauernd, ich solle trainieren. Meine Beine sagen mir jedoch etwas anderes.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.5": "Du bist derjenige, über den jeder spricht, oder etwa nicht?",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.6": "The clock tower is the best spot in town. Sag das aber niemanden.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.7": "One day I will carry a strong keyblade like the masters do. Eines Tages.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.8": "Heartless in the outskirts again. Somebody should do something about that.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.9": "Do you ever second guess the union you picked? I sometimes do...",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.10": "I traded three days of Lux for this tunic. Worth it, I think.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.11": "My friend swears she saw a Heartless the size of a house. I do not believe her.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.12": "The masters never sleep. Have you noticed? I have never once seen one sit down.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.13": "If you find a good spot for Lux, keep it to yourself. That is my advice.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.14": "Somebody left a keyblade lying in the fountain yesterday. Nobody has claimed it.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.15": "I am not afraid of the dark. I simply prefer the daytime, that is all.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.16": "Die sagen uns andauernd, dass das Licht zur neige geht. Ich sehe keinen Unterschied.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.17": "Between you and me, I still cannot summon mine on the first try.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.18": "Careful past the outer walls. That is where the ones that scratch are.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.19": "I hear the other unions are ahead of us this week. Schon wieder.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.20": "Glaubst du, dass es jemals aufhören wird? Das Lux-Sammeln, meine ich.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.21": "Meine Hände tun weh. Niemand hat mir gesagt, dass ein Schlüsselschwert so schwer sein würde.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.22": "Some of us are only here because our families sent us. Not me. I chose this.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.23": "Wenn du meinen Bruder siehst, sage ihm, dass ich noch immer auf das Lux warte, dass er mir schuldet.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.apprentice.greeting.24": "Good hunting out there. Try to come back in one piece.",


	// -foreteller
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.first_meeting.answer.come": "Wohin führen Sie mich?",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.first_meeting.answer.leave": "Ich muss darüber nachdenken.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.first_meeting.answer.open": "Öffne es.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.first_meeting.answer.who": "Wer sind Sie?",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.first_meeting.answer.why": "Wieso ich?",

	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.first_meeting.greeting.1": "Ihr wart es also. I felt a new keyblade wake, and the world it belongs to open along with it.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.first_meeting.greeting.2": "I have traveled from a far place following that feeling. Gebt mir einen Moment eures Morgens.",

	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.first_meeting.offer.1": "Dann lasst mich euch lehren. Doch nicht hier, wo jeder Schatten uns zuhört, sondern an einem Ort, an dem das Bündnis das Gleichgewicht bewahrt.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.first_meeting.offer.2": "I will open the way from where we stand, and leave it active. Come and go as you need to, bring what you must, this is not an afternoon's work.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.first_meeting.offer.3": "Ask me when you want to come back and I will send you. When you have learned enough to be worth the walk, the way will close, and after that you come to me by Gumi-Jet like everybody else.",

	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.first_meeting.who.1": "Ich bin {speaker}, einer der fünf Bündnisanführer. Each of us was given a book that tells what is coming, and a union to carry through it.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.first_meeting.who.2": "Ours is {union}. We'll be the voice you will hear when there is something you need to know.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.first_meeting.why.1": "Ein Schlüsselschwert ist kein Werkzeug. Es ist eine Tür, und Türen kann man von beiden Seiten öffnen. Die Dunkelheit hat dich bemerkt, genauso wie ich dich bemerkt habe.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.first_meeting.why.2": "Unbelehrt, wird es Euch finden, lange bevor ihr bereit seid. Mir ist es lieber, dass Ihr dafür bereit seid.",

	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.answer.ask": "Es gibt ein da ein paar Sachen, die ich noch nicht verstehe.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.answer.back": "Ich möchte es noch überdenken...",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.answer.graduate": "That one was harder...",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.answer.home": "Ich möchte zurück gehen.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.answer.leave": "Nichts. Entschuldigung für die Störung.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.answer.notyet": "Noch nicht.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.answer.ready": "Tu es.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.answer.send": "Ich komme wieder!",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.answer.shop": "Ich möchte Lux ausgeben.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.answer.spar": "Ich möchte gegen Euch antreten.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.answer.train": "Ich möchte trainieren!",

	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.answer.theory.keyblade": "Was ist ein \"Schlüsselschwert\"?",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.answer.theory.lux": "Und wofür ist \"Lux\" gut?",

	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.darkness.1": "Since you are going to face the darkness, you had better know how it fights.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.darkness.2": "So I will imbue the orbs with a little of it. Better you face it here than out there.",

	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.duels": "Gegen meine Wenigkeit? Choose the amount of effort you want me to put in.",

	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.graduation.1": "That is the last of what I can teach you right now. The rest is out there, and you will find it on your own.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.graduation.2": "Ich schließe den Weg, den ich geöffnet habe. Jedoch nicht um Euch zu bestrafen. Eine Tür, die noch ungeöffnet ist, wartet darauf von Jemanden oder Etwas gefunden zu werden.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.graduation.3": "Baut euch selbst einen Gumi-Jet. Come back to me after you've developed your own power and I will show you what the hard lessons look like, and cross keyblades with me.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.graduation.4": "Sammelt fleißig Lux dort draußen. When you return I will have goods worth trading it for, bring me a good amount and I will be able to bequeath you my keyblade.",

	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.greeting": "Hallo, was brauchst du?",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.home": "Du gehst schon? So gehe und erledige was noch getan werde muss, und komme wieder. Dein Training ist jedoch noch nicht vorbei.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.lessons": "Gegen Kugeln, nicht wahr? Sage mir wie schwer es sein darf.",

	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.theory": "So frage. Es ist besser von mir zu lernen, als in der Dunkelheit zu tappen.",

	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.theory_keyblade.1": "Eine Waffe ist etwas, dass du auswählst. Ein Schlüsselschwert ist etwas, dass dich auswählt. Es antwortet dem Herzen des Trägers, und niemand anderes.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.theory_keyblade.2": "That is why it opens what is locked and closes what should be. A door, a chest, the way between two worlds... they are all locks to it.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.theory_keyblade.3": "And it is why the darkness wants the ones who carry them. Take the wielder and you have taken the key.",

	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.theory_lux.1": "Lux ist die physische Form des Lichts. Jedes Herz gibt etwas davon ab; ein glückliches Herz wird heller scheinen.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.theory_lux.2": "When you strike down a Heartless you are not destroying light, you are letting go what it swallowed. The goal is to defeat the darkness that attempts to corrupt the worlds.",
	"kingdomkeys.dialogue.foreteller.theory_lux.3": "Your union counts what you bring in, but so do the other four, take it as a friendly competition.",



	// WARNINGS

